# difference from the reference -- "and", a leading "one", another split of
# the number, a spelling past the dictionary that combines scale words -- is
# a composition this target does not judge: shown, and passed.
#
# ex00_settled_words_diff sweeps every length up to 42 digits with ref.dict,
# and past it; ex00_settled_dicts_diff hands each case a fresh dictionary of
# random values, so English typed into the program fails on the first one.
